            <p class="art-title">Opt in, then grant</p>
            <pre class="code"><code>hikyo project-settings machine-reveal set --enabled true
hikyo access grant add --principal &lt;mch_...&gt; --capability reveal --env &lt;env-id&gt;</code></pre>
            <p class="art-note">
              Withdrawing the opt-in stops every machine secret delivery in the project on the next fetch, without
              touching any grant.
            </p>
